  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<p>Holiday 30A at Magnolia Cottages by the Sea, a small, quiet, and quaint neighborhood, is the perfect 30A getaway, especially with its location in the neighborhood. A spacious, custom 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, nice situated on the property for privacy and no home on one side. Relaxing from the moment you enter. <br></p><br><br><p>Ample parking for 2 cars and another small car or golf cart. There is a deeded beach access directly in front of the neighborhood. The pool is between the beach and the home; convenient with bathrooms. Take the bikes to the close shops & restaurants: 1M to Alys Beach, 1M to The Big Chill and 2 miles to Rosemary Beach. Only 6 miles to Seagrove/Seaside.</p><br><br><h2>The Home</h2><br><br><ul><li>Beautiful kitchen, fully equipped.</li><li>Large 75\" Smart TV in Living room.</li><li>Smart TVs in all bedrooms</li><li>Direct TV. and WIFI.</li><li>4 adult beach cruiser bikes.</li><li>4 backpack beach chairs.</li><li>6 beach towels.</li><li>Beach toys.</li><li>Pack-n-Play</li><li>High Chair</li><li>Beach cart.</li><li>2 Yoga mats.</li><li>Nice quality sheets & towels provided.</li><li>Washer and Dryer</li></ul><br><br><h3>Pool</h3><br><br><p>The pool was renovated two yrs ago and is located about midway between the home & beach. which is about two min walk.</p><br><br><h2>Outdoor Living Spaces</h2><br><br><ul><li>Parking for two cars and LSV or Golf Cart.</li><li>Stone paver driveway<br></li><li>Outdoor shower with hot & cold water.</li><li>Screened in porch.</li><li>Paver patio for lounging - plenty of seating, yoga & grilling.</li><li>Grill with charcoal.<br></li></ul><br><br><h2>Golf Carts</h2><br><br><p>There is a small amount of golf cart parking the front of the neighborhood between Morgan Ln & the Waterhouse condos. A golf cart to the beach is not really necessary to the beach, it's only about three hundred yards.</p><br><br><h2>Beach Access & Service</h2><br><br><p>In order to sit near the access, you must rent a \"beach setup\", consisting of 2 chairs and an umbrella. For beach chair rental call 904-708-1859 and ask for Shawn or Blain. You can bring some of the beach chairs in the shed with you for additional seating as well.</p><br><br><p>There is another small public beach access at Mistral just a one to two min walk to the west with a bike rack and you do not have to rent at this location. It also tends to be less crowded.</p><br><br><p><br></p>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Holiday 30A at Magnolia Cottages"
        }
      ],
